#: functions.inc.php:139
msgid ""
"The email address that completed dictations are sent FROM. Format is \"A "
"Persons Name &lt;email@address.com&gt;\", without quotes, or just a plain "
"email address."
msgstr ""
"完成的口述錄音由這個電子郵件地址寄出。格式為「A Persons Name &lt;email@address.com&gt;」，不加引號，或直接使用一般的電子郵件地址。"

#: functions.inc.php:138
msgid "The email address that completed dictations are sent to."
msgstr "完成的口述錄音要寄到的電子郵件地址。"

#: dictate.i18n.php:8
msgid ""
"This uses the app_dictate module of Asterisk to let users record dictate "
"into their phones. When complete, the dictations can be emailed to an email "
"address specified in the extension page."
msgstr ""
"這使用 Asterisk 的 app_dictate 模組，讓使用者可以對著電話錄製口述內容。完成後，口述內容可以透過電子郵件寄到分機頁面中指定的電子郵件地址。"
